WEBVTT

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.300
Miss Yujin!

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:15.970
Miss Yujin!

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:32.780
Miss Yujin.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:01.930
Mr. Minhyung!

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.560
Miss Yujin!

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:04.890
Mr. Minhyung?

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:06.640
Mr. Minhyung!

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:07.690
Yujin!

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.400
Miss Yujin!

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:09.980
Yujin!

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:11.690
Say something if you can hear me.

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:13.280
Mr. Minhyung!

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.410
Miss Yujin!

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:20.410
Mr. Minhyung!

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.330
This snow storm keeps getting worse.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:27.420
Yujin!

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:29.380
Mr. Minhyung!

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:31.540
Miss Yujin!

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:33.170
Mr. Minhyung!

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.880
I found them!

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:39.430
Where?

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.730
Mr. Minhyung, Miss Yujin!

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.530
Can you hear me?

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:44.530
Are you all right?

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:45.600
Mr. Minhyung!

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.310
We're ready to operate.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:12.870
Please get out of the way!

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:13.810
Out of the way.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.780
Do you know where you are, Mr. Minhyung?

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:21.200
You're in the hospital.

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:22.740
Wake up!

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:22.740
Oh, Minhyung...

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.740
Hey, Minhyung!

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.940
Miss Yujin.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.000
Miss Yujin!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.690
Can you hear me?

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:40.340
Miss Yujin!

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:41.420
Yujin!

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.150
Yujin.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.290
Joonsang...

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.870
It's you, right, Joonsang?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.900
You have no idea how long I've been waiting for you.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.340
What took you so long?

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.300
Yujin.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:20.210
Yujin.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:21.670
Yujin!

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:23.880
Are you all right, Yujin?

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:27.890
The doctor said you got away without breaking anything.

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.560
He said you should be able to take the cast off in a few days too.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.310
What about Joonsang?

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.060
Joonsang?

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:39.900
Where is he now?

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.660
Please be okay, Minhyung...

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.750
I'm sure he'll be okay, Chelin.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:56.120
He'll be fine, Chelin.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.090
Would you sit down for a minute, Chelin?

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:02.460
Don't worry so much.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:04.590
He'll pull through.

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:09.910
Is Minhyung all right?

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:10.620
He's okay, right?

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.850
He's fine, isn't he?

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:14.930
Fortunately, he hasn't sustained any serious external injuries.

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:19.690
The EMT's treatment also stabilized his hypothermia to within normal limits.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:24.740
However, he still hasn't regained consciousness, and—

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:25.950
Chelin!

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:27.360
He's all right, isn't he?

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:29.490
Yujin.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:30.700
Yujin!

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:33.490
Joonsang is all right, isn't he, Doctor?

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:32.180
Yujin.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:36.340
We'll need to run a few tests to check for internal bleeding

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:38.370
and possible brain damage.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:39.840
He's going to live, isn't he?

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:42.630
It's not a fatal injury, right?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.050
Yujin!

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:47.630
All we can do now is wait for him to regain consciousness.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.090
We'll keep a close eye on his progress for now.

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:55.310
Please save Joonsang!

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:56.600
Yujin!

00:05:58.520 --> 00:05:59.820
Did you say Joonsang?

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:01.690
Why are you calling Minhyung "Joonsang"?

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:04.510
It's all your fault;

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.280
it's all your fault that this happened to Minhyung!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.650
Come on, Chelin.

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:09.450
That's enough, Chelin.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.410
What did you do to him?

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.530
Joonsang, you say?

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:14.160
Hey...

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.410
In case you forgot,

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.620
Joonsang got into that accident trying to meet <i>you</i>.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:20.290
Chelin!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.210
You know that?

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:25.170
Was Joonsang's death not enough for you?

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:28.880
That's enough.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:30.530
Yujin!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.090
Yujin!

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.430
Get a hold of yourself, Yujin!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.600
Pull yourself together!

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.600
Yujin! Yujin!

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:45.680
She's probably still traumatized from the accident.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.490
I'm sure it's nothing a good rest can't fix.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.860
I really hope nothing's wrong with her.

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:51.860
Come on.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.590
I may only be a vet, but I'm still a doctor.

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:55.790
Trust me on this one.

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:56.570
Yujin!

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.500
Is Yujin all right, Sanghyuk?

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:00.830
Jeong-a!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:03.670
Yujin...

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.880
They said she didn't suffer any serious injuries.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.500
Thank goodness.

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:09.630
Are you the same Jeong-a Lee that came in with Unhappy?

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.510
Why is this guy here?

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:16.510
Do you guys know each other?

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.430
Has the patient been involved in any other accidents in the past?

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:23.520
I don't think he has.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.940
See this rupture line over here?

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:29.240
That's a hemoclip under his frontal skull here.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:32.990
It's a sign that he was treated for a serious injury in the past.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:35.110
I'll need to see his medical history

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:37.080
before deciding on an appropriate treatment.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:40.660
Have you contacted his next of kin yet?

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.460
I have, and since she left as soon as I called her,

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.040
she should arrive in Korea sometime tomorrow.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:51.160
When did he get into an accident?

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.760
He never mentioned anything.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.620
I couldn't stop thinking

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:26.920
about why you didn't tell me that you were working with Mr. Minhyung.

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:34.010
What makes me angry is that you still haven't forgotten about Joonsang.

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:38.970
He's a memory of yours; I can't compete against a memory.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:42.640
And that frustrates me.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.810
Yujin.

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.150
You're here, Mrs. Jung.

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:48.360
Yujin.

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:50.730
Thanks for staying with her despite being so busy.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:55.200
She should be getting up soon; should I wake her up?

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.950
Oh no, just let her sleep.

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:59.830
Don't worry too much, Mrs. Jung.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.120
Yujin is fine.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:04.790
Yes, thank you, Sanghyuk.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.330
You've done so much for her.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.790
I'm only doing what I'm supposed to do.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.170
Thank goodness she's not badly injured.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:14.740
Stop crying, Mom.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.680
He said Yujin's all right.

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:19.390
You must have a lot of work to do; you should get going, Sanghyuk.

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:21.680
I already told the station that I'd be here.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:24.350
It's okay, don't worry about Yujin.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:27.520
Don't worry, Sanghyuk; I'll be here with Yujin.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.040
Oh yeah?

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.190
Maybe I'll trust you on this one, Huijin.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:33.220
You said yourself that she's fine, right?

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:35.070
Don't worry, just leave her to me.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:36.900
Okay.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:39.420
In that case, I'll just go attend to a few urgent matters

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:40.200
and come right back.

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:42.700
You don't have to, really.

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.250
I figure I should bring some of her clothes

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.540
and other stuff on my way back.

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.290
Lucky Yujin.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.540
She's bagged herself such a considerate fiancé.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:50.970
Oh, you.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.460
I'll be back.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.010
Okay, take care.

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:55.380
See you.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:13.020
<i>Joonsang is all right, isn't he?</i>

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:16.610
<i>Please save Joonsang!</i>

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:20.030
<i>Joonsang is all right, isn't he?</i>

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:46.100
<i>Joonsang got into that accident trying to meet </i>you<i>.</i>

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.960
<i>And now you want to take Minhyung too?</i>

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.600
<i>You never cease to amaze me.</i>

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:36.650
I'm fine; go home and get some sleep, Mom.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:38.070
Are you sure?

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:38.730
Don't worry.

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:42.110
You have to go to work this evening, right?

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:45.740
But still...

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:49.950
Tell Huijin not to come here and go study instead, okay?

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.250
If you say so.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:58.250
It's cold out here; go back in.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.340
You too, Mom.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:52.010
So basically, Yujin wanted us to leave the basic building frame intact

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:54.640
and only replace the windows and the varnish inside, right?

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:54.910
Yes.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:55.850
Are you sure that's a good idea?

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:01.780
Well if you could take care of that for now,

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:04.250
I'll give you the details when Yujin comes back.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:05.400
I'm sorry.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:09.870
If anything were to happen to Minhyung, Mrs. Lee...

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.160
Mrs. Lee.

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.240
Thank you for worrying.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:18.750
I'm sure Minhyung will be all right.

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:21.420
I better get going.

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:33.640
I saw you in the lobby a few minutes ago, didn't I?

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:36.310
Do you need something from me?

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:41.890
If not, I need to get going.

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:43.150
I'm rather occupied.

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:44.690
Um...

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:47.960
I'm really sorry.

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.200
Joonsang...

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.330
Joonsang got hurt because of me.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:54.830
Excuse me?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:59.170
I mean, the Director got hurt because of me.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.590
Were you with Minhyung at the time of the accident?

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:04.460
I'm sorry.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:08.720
I see.

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:13.930
Have we met before?

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.970
I've had that feeling too;

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.730
have you ever lived in Chuncheon before?

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:22.870
No, I haven't.

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:24.730
You should probably head back to your room,

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.150
seeing as how you're injured.

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.580
Take it easy.

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:14.700
We have plenty of time.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:16.830
I'll get her clothes, Sanghyuk;

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:19.160
you get some books she might want to read.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.160
Okay.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.770
I'll support any decision you make, Doctor.

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:51.590
Manager Kim?

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.950
Get me Minhyung's medical records as soon as possible.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:55.990
It's urgent.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:57.780
Also,

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:01.500
call the agent and tell him to sell the house in Chuncheon right away.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:05.630
Make sure he does it right away; this is all because of that house.

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:29.360
Where to?

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.070
Excuse me.

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.240
Are you from the real estate office?

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:24.620
Feel free to look inside.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.580
You sure took your time getting here.

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:36.550
<i>Joonsang is dead.</i>

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:37.720
<i>Dead.</i>

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.440
<i>I'll prove it to you.</i>

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:41.890
<i>I'll clarify it right now.</i>

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.640
<i>That Minhyung,</i>

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:50.400
<i>the man you're so confused about, is not Joonsang.</i>

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.650
What did you say the student's name was?

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:55.990
Joonsang Kang.

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:56.930
Oh, here it is.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:57.860
Joonsang Kang.

00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.990
Thank you; that was fast.

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.740
I was worried that an old record might be hard to find, but I guess not.

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:04.740
Now that I think about it, someone else came looking for this too.

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.080
Who was it?

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.710
It was a woman.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:10.850
She begged me to find it for her,

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:13.360
saying she was a classmate of his or something,

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.050
so I just gave her his address.

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:21.150
Are you going to stay standing?

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:47.350
Minhyung!

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:48.970
Excuse me!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:51.020
Excuse me!

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:54.100
Doctor!

00:19:57.940 --> 00:19:59.570
Mr. Minhyung?

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:03.320
Nurse, prepare the ECG.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:03.880
Yes, Doctor.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:05.910
Why did you lie?

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:06.910
Joonsang—

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:09.140
I mean, Minhyung is...

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.240
Why?

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:15.750
Just call him whatever you like.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.500
Joonsang doesn't remember anything.

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:22.090
Not about me, not about Chuncheon.

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:26.090
"Yujin," was it?

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:28.600
Yes, that's right.

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:31.970
Does thinking about the past make you happy, Miss Yujin?

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.230
Does it make you happy?

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:39.360
I just want to know why Joonsang can't remember anything.

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.430
It's not that he can't remember anything,

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:44.360
we replaced his old memories with new ones.

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:49.700
"I've never lived in Korea."

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.330
"My name has always been Minhyung Lee."

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.500
Among others.

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:59.380
But why and how could you do this?

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.040
Something must have been wrong, right?

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.340
Where did it—

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:03.920
There was nothing wrong with him.

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:08.090
I just gave him new memories to try and end his suffering.

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:11.430
New memories?

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:14.930
<i>Those times that you so sorely want him to remember,</i>

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:18.690
<i>all the memories from back then</i>

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:21.740
<i>were tearing Joonsang apart,</i>

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:23.530
<i>and I couldn't bear to keep watching it.</i>

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:27.410
New memories...

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:29.760
New memories...

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:30.580
But why?

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.160
Why?

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:34.080
Don't think you were the only victim, Yujin.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:37.750
Joonsang was also suffering because of his old memories.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:40.880
Please,

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:43.250
don't tell anyone.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:49.640
Have you ever truly loved someone?

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:56.020
Have you ever had someone that was living and breathing right next to you

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:58.940
suddenly disappear into thin air?

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:01.730
Do you know what that feels like?

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:07.030
Nothing's changed around you,

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:09.740
except for the fact that one person is now gone.

00:22:10.070 --> 00:22:11.070
Miss Yujin...

00:22:11.740 --> 00:22:13.580
Can you even imagine how that feels?

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.220
Is it so wrong for me

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:19.250
to ache and suffer because of those feelings?

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:36.720
Hello?

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:38.980
Miss Chelin?

00:22:38.980 --> 00:22:39.770
Can you repeat that?

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:43.100
Minhyung's awake?

00:23:06.340 --> 00:23:07.210
Yujin...
